      "message": "If the ABI monitoring was enabled on android16-6.12 then it\u0027s expected that it also started monitoring for changes here - later on we also would like to enable x86 monitoring (b/393500592)\n\nSee `What should I do if I broke the ABI?` in contribution guidelines on what to do:  https://docs.google.com/document/d/18eNEc_oQa9oF546E-MdeEReFhCvSb6Fv00vTBquRzjU/edit?tab\u003dt.pk1lw6tntelq#heading\u003dh.p4kuwdn6mr5b",
